{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00554","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭神州乐章 雍和 · 褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭神州乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泰折严享，阴郊展敬。\n礼以导神，乐以和性。\n黝牲在列，黄琮俯暎。\n九土既平，万邦贻庆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}